---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Licenses | Bare Bones SEO" description="Bare Bones SEO licenses: CC BY 4.0 for static-site standards and GPLv2 or later for the WordPress plugin.">
  <section class="wrap legal-page">
    <h1>Licenses</h1>
    <h2>Static-site standards</h2>
    <p>The <a href="https://github.com/charltondigital/bare-bones-seo-static-sites">Bare Bones SEO for Static Sites</a> documentation and standards are licensed under <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/">Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)</a>.</p>
    <p>Anyone may use, share, adapt, and commercially distribute the licensed documentation. If you redistribute or adapt the documentation, give appropriate credit to Charlton Digital LLC, link to the license, and indicate changes. <strong>Simply implementing these standards on your website does not require a public credit.</strong></p>
    <p>The <a href="https://github.com/charltondigital/bare-bones-seo-static-sites/blob/main/LICENSE.md">repository license notice</a> provides further details. The Bare Bones SEO name and skull logo are not licensed for use as the branding of another product.</p>
    <h2>WordPress plugin</h2>
    <p>The <a href="https://wordpress.org/plugins/bare-bones-seo/">Bare Bones SEO WordPress plugin</a> is free and open-source software, licensed under the <a href="https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/gpl-2.0.html">GNU General Public License version 2</a> or later.</p>
    <p class="date">Copyright © 2026 Charlton Digital LLC.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
<style>
  .legal-page{max-width:50rem;padding-block:var(--space-5) var(--space-6)}
  h1{font-size:clamp(2.7rem,6vw,4rem);margin-bottom:var(--space-3)}
  h2{font-size:1.5rem;margin-top:var(--space-4);margin-bottom:var(--space-2)}
  p{margin-bottom:var(--space-2);color:var(--ink-soft)}
  .date{font-size:.9rem;margin-top:var(--space-4)}
</style>
